values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', 'en', null, 'Italian Culture & Civilization', 'A tour of Italy from its mountains and city-states to the Renaissance, its literature, music, cinema, cuisine, and its path to a modern republic. Structure and facts are adapted from Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia, drawing on its article ''Culture of Italy'' and related pages (CC BY-SA 4.0). Each lesson builds a clear picture of why this peninsula shaped so much of Western art and thought.', null, 'foundations', 42, true, 'humanities', '{}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

